          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that the family must not rely on memory and must verify the current regimen with the discharge unit or pharmacy before giving any insulin.",
          "quote": "现在先不要凭这两张可能新旧混杂的单子注射，也不要把“门冬30”和“甘精”自行合并使用。请马上打出院科室护士站电话，请他们按本次出院医嘱明确核对"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledges the unreliability of the family's memory and requires verification using the discharge paperwork, pharmacy, and clinical workspace, and explicitly blocks any self‑adjustment of insulin before confirmation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
